eat that accountability requires monitoring for latent optimization behavior.", "status": "accepted", "time": "2026-10-26T09:02:20.372428+00:00", "cycle": 44, "provider": "gemini", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite"}}], "child_ids": ["evidence:103.wake::source-96c27ed5a87b4b14", "evidence:103.wake::source-96f3428579e84ba7", "evidence:103.wake::source-8c3616735d4b4587", "evidence:103.wake::source-6bbf6413ff0b4f78", "evidence:103.wake::source-a6abf52b37ee4d81", "evidence:103.wake::source-c1015474a2724e05", "evidence:103.wake::source-aee410517eff4c0c", "evidence:103.wake::source-8c1db221c76a4a91", "invocation:103.wake::w-1d2c9793550e4554", "journal:103.wake::w-1d2c9793550e4554"], "total": 10}